      "overview_description": {
        "description": "MICAD Credit JV operates as an institutional alternative investment vehicle specializing in global private credit strategies, including direct lending across US and European markets. The platform's core business model focuses on capturing risk-adjusted returns by deploying tailored, non-bank financing directly to mid-sized companies, asset-backed corporate borrowers, and real estate developers. Its value proposition centers on structuring customized credit transactions while giving strategic institutional backers expanded access to diversified, high-quality international loan opportunities."
      },
